    {
      "id": "2170fc7b412a8efd",
      "slug": "grand-group-hike",
      "title": "Grand group hike",
      "description": "Another post (https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfi87u_k53e) gives the time as 05:00.\n\nAnother post (https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfi87u_k53e) gives the venue as Benog Tibba (Cloud End), Mussoorie; meeting point Pacific Hills, Mussoorie Diversion, Rajpur Road.\n\nHappy and safe Diwali to everyone and their families\n\nSo today our group is off on the occasion of Diwali, but I can't sit at home, so I decided to go alone into the forest and do a solo jungle hike in my nearby forest.\n\nPin-drop silence and I am the only one in this forest. It's scary in the daytime, but I am used to it.\n\nSo I did my 10 km hike on the forest trail and I feel so relaxed after this. In nature, I feel so connected and I got all the answers running in my mind.\n\nSo we will meet next Sunday and again do a grand group hike.\n\nSee you guys",
